          {
            "type": "section",
            "value": {
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "<h2 data-block-key=\"ov01\">Overview</h2><p data-block-key=\"ov02\">The Tabs block is the content-level counterpart to Tabbed Content. While Tabbed Content is a structural block whose tabs hold structural children (sections, columns, heroes), Tabs is a content block whose tabs hold content children (text, CTAs, cards, accordions).</p><p data-block-key=\"ov03\">Because Tabs is a content block, it can be placed inside columns, sections, wells, and other content slots. Structural concerns like background colors are handled by a parent Section.</p>",
                  "id": "a7c2d1e8-0002-0000-0000-000000000001"
                }
              ],
              "config": [
                {
                  "type": "padding_bottom",
                  "value": 1,
                  "id": "a7c2d1e8-0002-0000-0000-000000000002"
                }
              ]
            },
            "id": "a7c2d1e8-0002-0000-0000-000000000003"
          },
          {
            "type": "section",
            "value": {
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "<h2 data-block-key=\"cfg01\">Config</h2><p data-block-key=\"cfg02\"><b>tab_alignment</b>: align tabs left (default), center, or right.</p><p data-block-key=\"cfg03\"><b>active_color</b>: hex color for the active tab underline.</p><p data-block-key=\"cfg04\"><b>default_tab</b>: zero-based index of which tab to show initially.</p><p data-block-key=\"cfg05\"><b>analytics_label</b>: label for analytics events within this block.</p><p data-block-key=\"cfg06\"><b>id</b>: HTML id for anchor link targeting.</p>",
                  "id": "a7c2d1e8-0003-0000-0000-000000000001"
                }
              ],
              "config": [
                {
                  "type": "padding",
                  "value": 1,
                  "id": "a7c2d1e8-0003-0000-0000-000000000002"
                }
              ]
            },
            "id": "a7c2d1e8-0003-0000-0000-000000000003"
          },
          {
            "type": "section",
            "value": {
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "<h2 data-block-key=\"ex01\">Examples</h2><h3 data-block-key=\"ex02\">Tabs inside a section</h3>",
                  "id": "a7c2d1e8-0004-0000-0000-000000000001"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tabs",
                  "value": {
                    "tabs": [
                      {
                        "label": "Overview",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "value": "<h3 data-block-key=\"a01\">Welcome</h3><p data-block-key=\"a02\">This is the simplest use of the Tabs block: text content organized into switchable panels. Each tab holds content blocks like text, CTAs, and cards.</p>",
                            "id": "a7c2d1e8-0004-1111-0000-000000000001"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "a7c2d1e8-tab1"
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Details",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "value": "<h3 data-block-key=\"b01\">More information</h3><p data-block-key=\"b02\">Tabs follow WAI-ARIA best practices: arrow keys cycle between tabs, Home/End jump to first/last, and screen readers announce proper roles.</p>",
                            "id": "a7c2d1e8-0004-1111-0000-000000000002"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "a7c2d1e8-tab2"
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "FAQ",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "value": "<h3 data-block-key=\"c01\">Frequently asked</h3><p data-block-key=\"c02\">You can add as many tabs as you need. Selecting a tab swaps the panel below without reloading the page.</p>",
                            "id": "a7c2d1e8-0004-1111-0000-000000000003"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "a7c2d1e8-tab3"
                      }
                    ],
                    "config": []
                  },
                  "id": "a7c2d1e8-0004-1111-0000-000000000010"
                }
